  "31": ["Round traffic lights: green and yellow", "Green permits movement. Flashing green also permits it but warns that it is ending. Yellow prohibits movement, except as in clause 42, and warns of a change.", "What does a yellow light mean?", ["Movement is prohibited, the signal is about to change", "Speed up", "Proceed freely"]],
