  "66": ["Three lane roads", "On a marked two-way road with three lanes, the middle lane is shared and may be used only to overtake, bypass, turn left or make a U turn. The far left lane for oncoming traffic is prohibited.", "On a three lane two-way road, the middle lane may be used for…", ["Overtaking, bypassing, left turns and U turns", "Ordinary driving", "Parking"]],
  "67": ["Keep right", "Outside settlements and where higher speeds are allowed, drive as close to the right edge as practicable. Do not use left lanes while the right ones are free.", "Outside settlements, where should you drive when the right lane is free?", ["In the right lane", "In the left lane", "On the line"]],
